Commit:  9f8b6dba8b5ef1b26309a571ae75cda4034279e5
License: MIT (see LICENSE in this directory)

Vendored in-tree: the curated C subset is committed under `src/` (the `src/*.c`
+ `src/*.h` that make up the `lcurl` C module). We do NOT vendor the optional
`cURL/*.lua` helper layer, the upstream Makefile/build glue, tests, docs, or CI
config. `scripts/watchdog-lua-deps.sh` compiles `src/*.c` directly into
`.deps/lua/lcurl.so` -- there is no build-time download and no pin to verify,
because the compiled bytes are exactly this in-tree source.

